## DarkestHour: должности

dh-job-captain-name = Captain
dh-job-captain-description = Commands the station on behalf of Metallistick Group and answers for every department.

dh-job-adjutant-name = Adjutant
dh-job-adjutant-description = The captain's right hand: issues dog tags and access, keeps crew records and paperwork in order.

dh-job-metall-armed-specialist-name = Metall Armed Specialist
dh-job-metall-armed-specialist-description = A Metall Armed officer attached to the station. Guards the command staff and reports to Metall Armed.

dh-job-security-chief-name = Corporate Security Chief
dh-job-security-chief-description = Heads Metallistick corporate security: officers, the brig, investigations and the armory.

dh-job-warden-name = Warden
dh-job-warden-description = Runs the brig and the armory, keeps prisoners and their sentences.

dh-job-detective-name = Detective
dh-job-detective-description = Leads investigations: crime scenes, evidence and forensics.

dh-job-investigator-name = Investigator
dh-job-investigator-description = Works cases under the detective: interviews, evidence and paperwork.

dh-job-security-officer-name = Security Officer
dh-job-security-officer-description = Patrols the station and enforces the Territorial Code.

dh-job-security-pilot-name = Security Pilot
dh-job-security-pilot-description = Flies the security shuttle and keeps it ready for a jump.

dh-job-security-instructor-name = Security Instructor
dh-job-security-instructor-description = Trains cadets and keeps the security squad in shape.

dh-job-security-cadet-name = Security Cadet
dh-job-security-cadet-description = A corporate security trainee. Learn from the instructor and the officers.

dh-job-chief-physician-name = Chief Physician
dh-job-chief-physician-description = Heads the medical department.

dh-job-lead-physician-name = Lead Physician
dh-job-lead-physician-description = The senior physician on shift. Runs surgery and the treatment floor.

dh-job-chemist-name = Chemist
dh-job-chemist-description = Makes medicine and chemicals for the station.

dh-job-physician-name = Physician
dh-job-physician-description = Treats the wounded and the sick.

dh-job-paramedic-name = Paramedic
dh-job-paramedic-description = Recovers the injured from across the station and brings them to medbay.

dh-job-medical-intern-name = Medical Intern
dh-job-medical-intern-description = A medical trainee. Assist the physicians and learn.

dh-job-quartermaster-name = Quartermaster
dh-job-quartermaster-description = Heads the supply department and handles Metallistick Group orders.

dh-job-expeditor-name = Expeditor
dh-job-expeditor-description = Flies suborbital expeditions to the planet and brings back resources.

dh-job-loader-name = Loader
dh-job-loader-description = Loads, unloads and delivers cargo around the station.

dh-job-research-director-name = Research Director
dh-job-research-director-description = Heads the science department and its research.

dh-job-lead-scientist-name = Lead Scientist
dh-job-lead-scientist-description = The senior scientist on shift. Runs experiments and the research plan.

dh-job-materials-scientist-name = Materials Scientist
dh-job-materials-scientist-description = Studies and synthesizes materials, from plasteel to chronite.

dh-job-virologist-name = Virologist
dh-job-virologist-description = Studies diseases and makes vaccines together with medbay.

dh-job-lab-assistant-name = Lab Assistant
dh-job-lab-assistant-description = A science trainee. Assist the scientists and keep the labs clean.

dh-job-chief-technician-name = Chief Technician
dh-job-chief-technician-description = Heads the engineering department, the reactor and the station's orbit.

dh-job-lead-technician-name = Lead Technician
dh-job-lead-technician-description = The senior technician on shift. Runs repairs and the reactor floor.

dh-job-atmos-technician-name = Atmospheric Technician
dh-job-atmos-technician-description = Maintains atmospherics and the reactor's cooling loop.

dh-job-technician-name = Technician
dh-job-technician-description = Keeps the station powered and in one piece.

dh-job-junior-technician-name = Junior Technician
dh-job-junior-technician-description = An engineering trainee. Assist the technicians and learn.

